      "settings": {
        "display_id": false,
        "visibility": "always-display",
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"fail-wrap\">\n\n  <h2 class=\"fail-heading\">Why Most Kids <em>Crumble</em> When Life Gets Hard</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"fail-list\">\n\n    <div class=\"fail-item\">\n      <h3>1. Nobody Teaches Them to Handle Failure</h3>\n      <p>School teaches kids how to get the right answer. Nobody teaches them what to do when everything goes wrong. So the first time life doesn't go their way — they fall apart.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"fail-item\">\n      <h3>2. They Think Smart Means Never Making Mistakes</h3>\n      <p>Kids who struggle with failure think intelligence means getting it right the first time. It doesn't. The most successful people in history failed constantly — and knew exactly how to use it.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"fail-item\">\n      <h3>3. Life Principles Are Taught Too Late</h3>\n      <p>Between ages 8–12, kids form their permanent framework for how the world works. If nobody gives them real principles during this window, they build their worldview from YouTube comments and peer pressure.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"fail-item\">\n      <h3>4. Boring Books Don't Stick</h3>\n      <p>Kids have been handed dry self-help content dressed up as children's books their whole lives. They can smell it. They put it down after two pages. Nothing lands. Nothing changes.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"fail-item\">\n      <h3>5. Wisdom Gets Lost in Lectures</h3>\n      <p>Parents and teachers repeat the same advice over and over. Kids nod and ignore it. Wisdom only sticks when kids discover it themselves — through stories, humor, and moments that make them think.</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"fail-result\">\n    <p>The result? Kids who panic when plans fall apart. Who blame others when things go wrong. Who have no mental tools for navigating a world that is <em>gloriously, inevitably imperfect.</em></p>\n    <strong>Murphy's Law doesn't just warn kids that things go wrong — it teaches them exactly what to do when they do. 🧠</strong>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .fail-wrap {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 680px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 0 16px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n  }\n\n  /* ── HEADING ── */\n  .fail-heading {\n    font-size: clamp(21px, 4vw, 28px);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    letter-spacing: -0.4px;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n    margin: 0 0 22px 0;\n  }\n  .fail-heading em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  /* ── LIST ── */\n  .fail-list {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  /* ── ITEM ── */\n  .fail-item {\n    padding: 18px 18px 18px 20px;\n    border-left: 3px solid #c0392b;\n    background: #fff;\n    border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(13,27,62,0.06);\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n  }\n  .fail-item:hover {\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(13,27,62,0.1);\n    transform: translateX(2px);\n  }\n  .fail-item h3 {\n    font-size: clamp(14px, 2.5vw, 15px);\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .fail-item p {\n    font-size: clamp(13px, 2vw, 14px);\n    line-height: 1.68;\n    color: #6b7280;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  /* ── RESULT BOX ── */\n  .fail-result {\n    background: #0d1b3e;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 32px);\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .fail-result::before {\n    content: '⚡';\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -10px; right: 16px;\n    font-size: 80px;\n    opacity: 0.04;\n    line-height: 1;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .fail-result p {\n    font-size: clamp(13px, 2.5vw, 15px);\n    line-height: 1.75;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .fail-result em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n  .fail-result strong {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: clamp(13px, 2.5vw, 15px);\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #f5a623;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n\n  /* ── MOBILE ── */\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .fail-wrap { padding: 0 4px; }\n    .fail-item {\n      padding: 16px 14px 16px 16px;\n      border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\n    }\n    .fail-item:hover { transform: none; }\n    .fail-result { padding: 22px 18px; }\n  }\n</style>",
