    "custom_liquid_nnxrf7": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "display_id": false,
        "visibility": "always-display",
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"rev-wrap\">\n\n  <h2 class=\"rev-heading\">What Parents Are <em>Saying</em></h2>\n\n  <div class=\"rev-list\">\n\n    <div class=\"rev-card\">\n      <div class=\"rev-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n      <p class=\"rev-text\">\"My son quoted Murphy's Law at the dinner table after spilling his juice. Instead of crying he just laughed and said 'anything that can go wrong, will go wrong.' I nearly fell off my chair.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"rev-author\">\n        <img class=\"rev-avatar\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=47\" alt=\"Sarah M.\" />\n        <div class=\"rev-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"rev-name\">Sarah M.</span>\n          <span class=\"rev-meta\">Mom of two · Texas · <span class=\"rev-verified\">✔ Verified buyer</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rev-card\">\n      <div class=\"rev-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n      <p class=\"rev-text\">\"My daughter used to fall apart when things went wrong. Three weeks after reading this she's problem-solving instead of panicking. Her teacher noticed. I noticed. Genuinely remarkable.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"rev-author\">\n        <img class=\"rev-avatar\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=32\" alt=\"Emily R.\" />\n        <div class=\"rev-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"rev-name\">Emily R.</span>\n          <span class=\"rev-meta\">Mom of one · Ohio · <span class=\"rev-verified\">✔ Verified buyer</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rev-card\">\n      <div class=\"rev-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n      <p class=\"rev-text\">\"I bought this as an add-on and it ended up being the book my kid reads the most. The comic style makes it feel like entertainment. The life lessons make it feel like parenting gold.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"rev-author\">\n        <img class=\"rev-avatar\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=12\" alt=\"James K.\" />\n        <div class=\"rev-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"rev-name\">James K.</span>\n          <span class=\"rev-meta\">Father of two · California · <span class=\"rev-verified\">✔ Verified buyer</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rev-card\">\n      <div class=\"rev-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n      <p class=\"rev-text\">\"Short chapters, funny illustrations, real wisdom. My 9-year-old read the whole thing in two days. I've tried to get him to read for years. This is the first book he finished without being asked.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"rev-author\">\n        <img class=\"rev-avatar\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=25\" alt=\"Lisa W.\" />\n        <div class=\"rev-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"rev-name\">Lisa W.</span>\n          <span class=\"rev-meta\">Mom of three · Florida · <span class=\"rev-verified\">✔ Verified buyer</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rev-card\">\n      <div class=\"rev-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n      <p class=\"rev-text\">\"We talk about Murphy's Law in our house now like it's a family saying. My kids reference it constantly. It gave them a framework for handling bad days and I didn't even have to explain it — the book did it for me.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"rev-author\">\n        <img class=\"rev-avatar\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=57\" alt=\"Michael T.\" />\n        <div class=\"rev-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"rev-name\">Michael T.</span>\n          <span class=\"rev-meta\">Father of three · Georgia · <span class=\"rev-verified\">✔ Verified buyer</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rev-card\">\n      <div class=\"rev-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n      <p class=\"rev-text\">\"Perfect for my overthinker. She used to spiral when plans changed. Now she shrugs and says 'Murphy's Law!' The shift in her attitude has been huge. Worth every penny.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"rev-author\">\n        <img class=\"rev-avatar\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=44\" alt=\"Jessica P.\" />\n        <div class=\"rev-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"rev-name\">Jessica P.</span>\n          <span class=\"rev-meta\">Mom of one · New York · <span class=\"rev-verified\">✔ Verified buyer</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rev-card\">\n      <div class=\"rev-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n      <p class=\"rev-text\">\"Bought it alongside the encyclopedia and honestly this one got read first. It's funny, visual, and the lessons genuinely stick. My 10-year-old now approaches problems with a completely different mindset.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"rev-author\">\n        <img class=\"rev-avatar\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=33\" alt=\"Daniel H.\" />\n        <div class=\"rev-author-info\">\n          <span class=\"rev-name\">Daniel H.</span>\n          <span class=\"rev-meta\">Father of two · Illinois · <span class=\"rev-verified\">✔ Verified buyer</span></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .rev-wrap {\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 640px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n  }\n\n  /* ── HEADING ── */\n  .rev-heading {\n    font-size: clamp(22px, 4.5vw, 28px);\n    font-weight: 900;\n    line-height: 1.18;\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n    margin: 0 0 24px 0;\n  }\n  .rev-heading em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  /* ── LIST ── */\n  .rev-list {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n  /* ── CARD ── */\n  .rev-card {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(13,27,62,0.07);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    padding: 24px 24px 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    box-shadow:\n      0 1px 3px rgba(13,27,62,0.05),\n      0 6px 20px rgba(13,27,62,0.06);\n    transition: transform 0.22s ease, box-shadow 0.22s ease;\n  }\n  .rev-card:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\n    box-shadow:\n      0 2px 6px rgba(13,27,62,0.07),\n      0 10px 28px rgba(13,27,62,0.10);\n  }\n\n  /* ── STARS ── */\n  .rev-stars {\n    color: #f59e0b;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  /* ── TEXT ── */\n  .rev-text {\n    font-size: clamp(13.5px, 2.2vw, 14.5px);\n    line-height: 1.72;\n    color: #1a1a2e;\n    font-style: italic;\n    margin: 0 0 18px 0;\n  }\n\n  /* ── AUTHOR ── */\n  .rev-author {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 11px;\n    padding-top: 16px;\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(13,27,62,0.06);\n  }\n\n  .rev-avatar {\n    width: 38px;\n    height: 38px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    border: 2px solid rgba(13,27,62,0.08);\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .rev-author-info {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 3px;\n  }\n\n  .rev-name {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #0d1b3e;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .rev-meta {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #9ca3af;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .rev-verified {\n    color: #166534;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  /* ── MOBILE ── */\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .rev-card {\n      padding: 20px 16px 18px;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n    }\n    .rev-card:hover { transform: none; }\n    .rev-stars { font-size: 14px; }\n    .rev-avatar { width: 34px; height: 34px; }\n    .rev-name { font-size: 13px; }\n    .rev-meta { font-size: 11.5px; }\n  }\n</style>",
